        "native": "Fran\u00e7ois Foucault, la quarantaine, est professeur agr\u00e9g\u00e9 de lettres au lyc\u00e9e Henri IV, \u00e0 Paris. Une suite d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e8nements le force \u00e0 accepter une mutation d\u2019un an dans un coll\u00e8ge de banlieue class\u00e9 REP +. Il redoute le pire. \u00c0 juste titre.",
        "english": "Teacher in the most prestigious highschool in the country, Fran\u00e7ois enjoys the life he\u2019s always known, in the intellectual and bourgeois society of Paris. Trapped in a situation where he\u2019s forced to accept a job in a school of a tough underprivileged suburb, he finds himself confronted to his own limits and to the upheaval of his values and certainties."
